---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {profile} from '../data/profile';import {url} from '../lib/url';
---
<Base title="Contact — Muhammad Irfan Waseem"><header class="page-head wrap"><p class="eyebrow">START A CONVERSATION</p><h1>What are you<br/><em>working on?</em></h1><p>Have a mobile app, a business workflow or a development opportunity in mind? Tell me a little about it.</p></header><section class="wrap page-body two-column"><div class="contact-details"><h2>Let’s connect.</h2><a class="contact-address" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a><p>For project enquiries, include the problem you want to solve, your intended users and any timing constraints.</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href={profile.github}>GitHub</a><a class="text-link" href={profile.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></div><p class="notice">Prefer email? The address above opens your mail app.</p></div><form class="contact-form" id="contact-form" action={profile.form} method="POST"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100"/></label><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254"/></label><label>Your message<textarea name="message" required minlength="10" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Tell me about your project or opportunity."></textarea></label><label class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Leave this empty<input name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label><p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button class="button primary" type="submit">Send message</button><p style="font-size:.8125rem">Your message is processed by Formspree. <a class="text-link" href={url('privacy/')}>Privacy details</a></p></form></section></Base>
